  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The kinetic energy of a body is determined from measurements of its momentum p and its mass m.</p>\n<p>The percentage uncertainties in the measurements are:</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td><p>p</p></td><td><p>± 3 %</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>m</p></td><td><p>± 4 %</p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the percentage uncertainty in the kinetic energy?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">7 %</li><li data-label=\"B\">10 %</li><li data-label=\"C\">13 %</li><li data-label=\"D\">14 %</li></ol>"
  },
